│   ├── run_full_evaluation.sh   — The two comparisons on the full benchmark, or with --subset
│   │                              on benchmarks/subset (about 3 h)
│   ├── run_pulr.sh              — ULR-Baseline vs P-ULR for one Ultimate release (per lasso trace)
│   ├── run_ulr_vs_upl.sh        — ULR vs UPL comparison (per whole program)
│   ├── run_pasttel_ulr_only.sh  — Run PaSTTeL standalone on JSON instances
